            <div class="pb-shell">
              <div class="pb-heading-row"><div><p class="pb-eyebrow">01 / PAYROLL, BEAUTIFULLY ORCHESTRATED</p><h2>Complex payroll.<br/><span class="pb-muted">Remarkably simple.</span></h2></div><p class="pb-section-description">From the first input to the final payslip, move through a guided payroll journey with clarity, control and confidence.</p></div>
              <div class="pb-cockpit">
                <div class="pb-cockpit-top"><div class="pb-cockpit-brand">p<span>.</span></div><span>Payroll command centre</span><span class="pb-demo-label">ILLUSTRATIVE PREVIEW</span><span class="pb-cockpit-avatar">JD</span></div>
                <div class="pb-cockpit-layout">
                  <aside class="pb-cockpit-sidebar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="is-current">◈ <b>Overview</b></span><span>◎ <b>People</b></span><span>≋ <b>Pay runs</b></span><span>ƒ <b>Formula engine</b></span><span>▤ <b>Payslip Studio</b></span><span>✦ <b>PayAI</b></span><div>WORKSPACE<br/><strong>Southeast Asia + India</strong></div></aside>
                  <div class="pb-cockpit-main"><div class="pb-cockpit-title"><div><small>YOUR PAYROLL, IN PERSPECTIVE</small><h3>A good day to run payroll.</h3></div><span class="pb-pill">● Ready for review</span></div>
                    <div class="pb-metrics"><div><span>People in this run</span><strong>1,284</strong><small>Across 7 countries</small></div><div><span>Total payroll · USD equivalent</span><strong>$4.92<span>M</span></strong><small>Unified reporting view</small></div><div><span>Review progress</span><strong>96<span>%</span></strong><small>12 items need your attention</small></div></div>
                    <div class="pb-cockpit-lower"><div class="pb-run-card"><div class="pb-card-label"><strong>Your next payday</strong><span>September 2026</span></div><div class="pb-run-stages"><span class="is-done">✓ <b>Prepare</b></span><span class="is-done">✓ <b>Calculate</b></span><span class="is-active">03 <b>Review</b></span><span>04 <b>Approve</b></span></div><div class="pb-review-row"><span class="pb-country-code">SG</span><div>Singapore<small>Payroll calculated</small></div><span class="pb-pill">Ready to review</span></div><div class="pb-review-row"><span class="pb-country-code">IN</span><div>India<small>Payroll calculated</small></div><span class="pb-pill">Ready to review</span></div></div><div class="pb-pulse-card"><span class="pb-spark">✦</span><small>PAYAI / PAYROLL PULSE</small><h4>The story behind<br/>your pay run.</h4><p>Payroll is up 3.1% this period. New hires account for most of the increase.</p><a href="#intelligence">Explore AI insights <span>↗</span></a></div></div>
