            <div class="pb-shell">
              <div class="pb-heading-row"><div><p class="pb-eyebrow"><span class="pb-spark">✦</span> 02 / MEET PAYAI</p><h2>Your numbers.<br/><span class="pb-text-glow">Now with a point of view.</span></h2></div><p class="pb-section-description">Turn payroll data into understanding. Ask a question, uncover a trend, get a clear summary — and see what deserves your attention next.</p></div>
              <div class="pb-ai-grid"><div class="pb-ai-copy"><h3>Intelligence that<br/>works with you.</h3><p>A conversational layer for the people making payroll decisions. Less time searching. More time understanding.</p><div class="pb-ai-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="AI capability previews"><button id="pb-ai-tab-analytics" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="pb-ai-panel" tabindex="0" data-ai="analytics"><span>↗</span><div><strong>Conversational analytics</strong><small>Ask naturally. See the bigger picture.</small></div><span>→</span></button><button id="pb-ai-tab-summary" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-ai-panel" tabindex="-1" data-ai="summary"><span>≋</span><div><strong>Clear, executive summaries</strong><small>From complex data to a useful story.</small></div><span>→</span></button><button id="pb-ai-tab-pulse" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-ai-panel" tabindex="-1" data-ai="pulse"><span>◎</span><div><strong>Proactive payroll pulse</strong><small>Spot unusual changes. Focus your review.</small></div><span>→</span></button><button id="pb-ai-tab-forecast" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-ai-panel" tabindex="-1" data-ai="forecast"><span>⌁</span><div><strong>Forecasts &amp; planning</strong><small>Explore what your next period could look like.</small></div><span>→</span></button></div></div>
                <div class="pb-ai-preview" id="pb-ai-panel" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="pb-ai-tab-analytics"><div class="pb-ai-preview-top"><span>✦ PayAI</span><small>ILLUSTRATIVE PREVIEW</small><span class="pb-live-dot"></span></div><div class="pb-ai-question" id="pb-ai-question">How is our payroll changing across countries?</div><div class="pb-ai-answer"><span class="pb-ai-symbol">✦</span><div><small>THE BIGGER PICTURE</small><h3 id="pb-ai-title">Seven countries.<br/>One clear perspective.</h3><p id="pb-ai-answer">Compare payroll costs across your region, then explore the people and departments behind the change.</p></div></div><div class="pb-ai-chart"><div class="pb-chart-label"><span id="pb-ai-chart-title">Payroll distribution</span><span id="pb-ai-chart-note">USD equivalent</span></div><div class="pb-bars" aria-label="Illustrative country payroll distribution"><div style="--bar:84%"><i></i><span>SG</span></div><div style="--bar:56%"><i></i><span>IN</span></div><div style="--bar:46%"><i></i><span>MY</span></div><div style="--bar:67%"><i></i><span>VN</span></div><div style="--bar:38%"><i></i><span>ID</span></div><div style="--bar:28%"><i></i><span>TH</span></div><div style="--bar:18%"><i></i><span>KH</span></div></div></div><div class="pb-ai-insight"><span>✦</span><p id="pb-ai-insight">Go beyond the total. Understand the drivers.</p></div><a class="pb-ai-prompt" href="/demo/register"><span>Discover what you can ask PayAI</span><span>↗</span></a></div>
              </div>
              <div class="pb-ai-outcomes"><span><b>Ask</b> in plain language</span><span><b>Understand</b> the drivers</span><span><b>Summarise</b> for decision makers</span><span><b>Plan</b> with perspective</span></div>
            </div>
