          <section class="pb-section pb-studio" id="studio"><div class="pb-shell"><div class="pb-studio-heading"><p class="pb-eyebrow">03 / POWERFUL UNDERNEATH. INTUITIVE ON TOP.</p><h2>Your payroll.<br/><span>Designed your way.</span></h2><p>Flexible tools for the rules, connections and finishing touches that make your payroll yours.</p></div>
              <article class="pb-formula-feature"><div class="pb-feature-copy"><span class="pb-feature-number">01 / FORMULA ENGINE</span><h3>Big logic.<br/>Beautifully simple.</h3><p>Turn your pay policies into connected calculation rules. Build salary components, validate formulas and understand dependencies — with intelligence supporting the way you work.</p><ul><li>Flexible rules for earnings and deductions</li><li>Live validation and dependency visibility</li><li>AI assistance for building and understanding formulas</li></ul><a class="pb-dark-link" href="/demo/register">Explore the formula engine <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="pb-formula-art"><div class="pb-art-toolbar"><span>ƒ Formula engine</span><small>INTERACTIVE EXAMPLE</small><span>•••</span></div><div class="pb-formula-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Example salary formulas"><button class="is-active" data-formula="allowance" aria-pressed="true">Allowance</button><button data-formula="bonus" aria-pressed="false">Bonus</button><button data-formula="overtime" aria-pressed="false">Overtime</button></div><div class="pb-formula-rule"><span>CALCULATION RULE</span><code id="pb-formula-code">BASIC × ALLOWANCE_RATE</code><span class="pb-formula-valid">✓ Formula validated</span></div><div class="pb-formula-flow"><div><small id="pb-formula-input-label">Basic salary</small><b id="pb-formula-input">50,000</b></div><span>→</span><div><small id="pb-formula-rate-label">Allowance rate</small><b id="pb-formula-rate">20%</b></div><span>→</span><div class="pb-formula-result"><small>Calculated result</small><b id="pb-formula-result">10,000</b></div></div><div class="pb-formula-ai"><span>✦</span><div><b>Logic you can understand.</b><p id="pb-formula-explanation">This rule calculates the allowance as 20% of basic salary.</p></div></div><small class="pb-example-note">Sample values only. Your rules, rates and policies are configurable.</small></div></article>
              <div class="pb-studio-grid"><article class="pb-studio-card"><div class="pb-mapping-art" aria-label="Illustration of source data mapped to payroll fields"><div class="pb-art-toolbar"><span>◈ Intelligent mappings</span><small>PREVIEW</small></div><div class="pb-map-columns"><div><small>YOUR SOURCE</small><span>Employee ID <i>●</i></span><span>Monthly salary <i>●</i></span><span>Work location <i>●</i></span></div><div class="pb-map-connectors"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div><small>YOUR PAYROLL</small><span><i>●</i> Employee</span><span><i>●</i> Basic pay</span><span><i>●</i> Country</span></div></div><div class="pb-mapping-status">✓ Connected, validated, ready.</div></div><div class="pb-studio-card-copy"><span class="pb-feature-number">02 / INTELLIGENT MAPPINGS</span><h3>Everything clicks into place.</h3><p>Connect source fields to the right payroll inputs. Create reusable mappings, validate incoming data and bring your systems into a connected workflow.</p></div></article><article class="pb-studio-card"><div class="pb-payslip-art"><div class="pb-payslip-paper"><div><b>payobook.</b><span>PAYSLIP / SEPTEMBER</span></div><p>A clear picture of your pay.</p><div class="pb-payslip-line"><span>Earnings</span><b>₹75,000</b></div><div class="pb-payslip-line"><span>Deductions</span><b>₹8,500</b></div><div class="pb-payslip-net"><span>Net pay</span><strong>₹66,500</strong></div><small>ILLUSTRATIVE PAYSLIP</small></div><div class="pb-payslip-tools"><span>▤</span><span>◐</span><span>＋</span></div><div class="pb-payslip-chip">YOUR BRAND. YOUR LAYOUT.</div></div><div class="pb-studio-card-copy"><span class="pb-feature-number">03 / PAYSLIP STUDIO</span><h3>Every payday, beautifully delivered.</h3><p>Create a pay statement that feels like your brand. Shape the layout, organise components and make earnings, deductions and net pay easy to understand.</p></div></article></div>
            </div></section>
          <section class="pb-section pb-countries" id="countries"><div class="pb-shell"><div class="pb-heading-row"><div><p class="pb-eyebrow">04 / GLOBAL VISION. LOCAL DETAIL.</p><h2>A world of possibility.<br/><span class="pb-muted">A region we know.</span></h2></div><p class="pb-section-description">Global payroll starts with getting the local details right. Ready templates for South East Asia + India. Supports payroll processing of all countries — with flexible formulas and mappings to configure your payroll policies in one connected platform.</p></div><div class="pb-region-layout"><div class="pb-region-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pb-region-orbit"></span><span class="pb-region-core">p<span>.</span></span><span class="pb-region-node n1">IN</span><span class="pb-region-node n2">SG</span><span class="pb-region-node n3">VN</span><span class="pb-region-node n4">MY</span><span class="pb-region-node n5">ID</span><span class="pb-region-node n6">TH</span><span class="pb-region-node n7">KH</span><small>SOUTHEAST ASIA + INDIA<br/><strong>CONNECTED BY DESIGN</strong></small></div><div><div class="pb-country-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Country payroll capabilities"><button id="pb-country-SG" role="tab" data-country="SG" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="pb-country-panel" tabindex="0">Singapore</button><button id="pb-country-IN" role="tab" data-country="IN" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-country-panel" tabindex="-1">India</button><button id="pb-country-MY" role="tab" data-country="MY" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-country-panel" tabindex="-1">Malaysia</button><button id="pb-country-VN" role="tab" data-country="VN" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-country-panel" tabindex="-1">Vietnam</button><button id="pb-country-ID" role="tab" data-country="ID" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-country-panel" tabindex="-1">Indonesia</button><button id="pb-country-TH" role="tab" data-country="TH" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-country-panel" tabindex="-1">Thailand</button><button id="pb-country-KH" role="tab" data-country="KH" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="pb-country-panel" tabindex="-1">Cambodia</button></div><div class="pb-country-panel" id="pb-country-panel" role="tabpanel" tabindex="0" aria-labelledby="pb-country-SG"><span class="pb-country-panel-code" id="pb-country-code">SG</span><p class="pb-eyebrow">LOCAL PAYROLL CAPABILITIES</p><h3 id="pb-country-name">Singapore</h3><p id="pb-country-description">Bring CPF contributions and local payroll levies into your pay run, with clear visibility from calculation to review.</p><div class="pb-country-chips" id="pb-country-chips"><span>CPF</span><span>SDL</span><span>FWL</span></div><a href="/demo/register" class="pb-text-link">Explore payroll for your team <span>↗</span></a></div></div></div></div></section>
          <section class="pb-section pb-more" id="more"><div class="pb-shell"><div class="pb-heading-row"><div><p class="pb-eyebrow">05 / BEYOND THE PAY RUN</p><h2>Payroll at the heart.<br/><span class="pb-muted">Your people, connected.</span></h2></div><p class="pb-section-description">A broader suite of capabilities, each with its own purpose. Bring the surrounding work together without losing focus on payroll.</p></div><div class="pb-more-grid"><article><span>◎</span><h3>People &amp; contracts</h3><p>Keep employee records, onboarding and contract details connected to payroll.</p></article><article><span>◷</span><h3>Workforce &amp; attendance</h3><p>Bring working time, schedules and leave into the wider employee journey.</p></article><article><span>✓</span><h3>Approvals &amp; governance</h3><p>Give reviews, decisions and sign-offs a clear place in your workflow.</p></article><article><span>⇄</span><h3>Connected systems</h3><p>Bring HR data into payroll with integrations, reusable mappings and validation.</p></article></div></div></section>
